  "outstanding_review": "Per-batch maceration and distillation dates for VAT28+ are 'derived' (inherited from the recorded VAT-fill/bottling date) except where a specific step date was recoverable from context (see notes on individual records). The Production!! tab's date column mixes literal dd/mm/yyyy strings with spreadsheet date serials that are sometimes day/month-swapped -- each serial in this manifest was resolved by chronological fit against its neighbours and, where available, an already founder-confirmed date (e.g. WB-022's VAT47 bottling), not by a single global format assumption. Six batches remain excluded: VAT52 (two distinct sub-issues, see excluded[] entry), VAT55, VAT57 (both awaiting their bottling row), and the still-unlabelled 'VAT56?' 26-bottle line. The Green Gold (gg01) trial output from VAT53 (row 2035) needs a script change (a sheet-sourced trial manifest section) before it can be imported at all -- tracked as a follow-up, not a curation gap. Rosella VAT26 (prior database, pre-Solstice) still needs founder confirmation that treating its RS01/RS02 flavour rows as the maceration step (no Solstice base to draw from that early) is the right call.",
